Yes, it sounds okay, though I'm not sure where the FDR comes in.

I'd hacked away at stepwise for QTL x covariate interactions, but never quite got it together.
But the idea is you could use the genome-wide LOD threshold for the QTLxcovariate interaction as a penalty in a penalized-LOD criterion, as done for the QTL in stepwiseqtl().

karl

